## License and Upstream Attribution

**Plex DBRepair Docker** is an independent Docker automation wrapper designed to simplify the use of ChuckPa's DBRepair utility, particularly for Unraid Community Applications users.

### Upstream DBRepair

DBRepair is developed and maintained by **ChuckPa**.

- **Upstream project:** https://github.com/ChuckPa/DBRepair
- **Original license:** https://github.com/ChuckPa/DBRepair/blob/main/LICENSE.txt
- **Official releases:** https://github.com/ChuckPa/DBRepair/releases

Copyright © 2022–2026 ChuckPa. All rights reserved.

DBRepair is proprietary software provided free of charge for use with Plex Media Server. Redistribution requires express written permission from ChuckPa.

All rights to the DBRepair executable, its associated trademarks, and upstream materials remain with ChuckPa.

### Docker Wrapper

The Dockerfile, entrypoint automation, and Unraid integration are maintained independently by bmartino1.

This project does not modify, reverse-engineer, or claim ownership of ChuckPa's DBRepair executable. It packages the official upstream release and automates execution inside an existing Plex Docker container.

Any license applied to this project's independently authored wrapper code does not apply to ChuckPa's DBRepair executable.

### Disclaimer

This project is an independent community integration and is not an official release of DBRepair or Plex Media Server.

Users should consult the upstream license and documentation before using or redistributing DBRepair.
